	<text xml:lang="la">
		<body>
			<div>
				<p>
					<s n="1" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z1"/>S.</s>
					<s n="2" xml:lang="la">Nulla alia de causa hactenus per aliquot septimanas <lb xml:id="p1z2"/>nullas ad te, dilecte frater, literas dedi, quam quod <lb xml:id="p1z3"/>nihil haberem operae precium scribendum, ut ne nunc <lb xml:id="p1z4"/>quidem habeo, et quod existimabam d. <persName ref="p8057">Campello</persName> scriptas <lb xml:id="p1z5"/>tibi quoque communicandas; huic enim interea scrip<lb xml:id="p1z6"/>si, dum ad te singulariter nihil.</s>
					<s n="3" xml:lang="la">Accepi autem tuas <lb xml:id="p1z7"/>ordine omnes, quas interea misisti, tum et <persName ref="p8089">Lentuli</persName> nost<lb xml:id="p1z8"/>ri literas et quae <persName ref="p8018">Hallero</persName> nostro mittebas acta fori vel iudicii <lb xml:id="p1z9"/>nuper constituti decernendi de caussis eorum, qui damnati <lb xml:id="p1z10"/>putantur prius quam auditi.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="4" xml:lang="la">Pro his tuis laboribus et <lb xml:id="p1z11"/>literis ago tibi gratias paratus aliquando, si queam, referre.</s>
					<s n="5" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z12"/>Silent iam aliquamdiu omnia; nullas mittunt ami<lb xml:id="p1z13"/>ci literas neque ex <placeName ref="l832">Gallia</placeName> neque ex <placeName ref="l822">Germania</placeName> aut <placeName ref="l2472">Polonia</placeName> <lb xml:id="p1z14"/><placeName>Belgicove</placeName>.</s>
					<s n="6" xml:lang="la">Quae ultimo habui, scripsi ad vos.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="7" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z15"/>Nunc non gravabor et rumores, sed obscuros et ea <lb xml:id="p1z16"/>lege vobis referre, quod pro certis plane non recito, <lb xml:id="p1z17"/>sed sicut accepi a fama et rumoribus, quos fere <lb xml:id="p1z18"/>vanos esse non ignoratis.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="8" xml:lang="la">Pro certo tamen vobis refero <lb xml:id="p1z19"/>illud: regem <placeName ref="l2472">Poloniae</placeName> legatione missa ad <placeName>Palatinum</placeName> <lb xml:id="p1z20"/>salvum accepisse conductum; venturum enim <lb xml:id="p1z21"/>regem et transiturum in <placeName ref="l2472">Poloniam</placeName>.</s>
					<s n="9" xml:lang="la">Fama vero spargitur <lb xml:id="p1z22"/><persName>Guysianam</persName> deo et hominibus bonis invisam gentem et in<lb xml:id="p1z23"/>felicem gregem pfafforum nolle, ut ex regno <persName>Andius</persName> discedat, <lb xml:id="p1z24"/>unde brevi in armis futuros regem ipsum et <lb xml:id="p1z25"/>regis fratrem, quem illi praeferunt regi, et hos inter se <lb xml:id="p1z26"/>committendos, quod minime vellem.</s>
					<s n="10" xml:lang="la">Quae adduntur de <lb xml:id="p1z27"/><placeName ref="l378">Lutetia</placeName> et <placeName ref="l367">Aurelia</placeName>, commemorare nolo etc.</s>
					<s n="11" xml:lang="la">Sunt iam <lb xml:id="p1z28"/>alii, qui referant d. a.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="12" xml:lang="la">Monbrun, exercitus in <placeName ref="l2772">Delphin<lb xml:id="p1z29"/>atu</placeName> Hugonothici ductorem, progredi fortiter et capere <lb xml:id="p1z30"/>arces et urbes et alicubi etiam <placeName ref="l862">Helvetiorum</placeName> <lb xml:id="p1z31"/>reliquias nonnihil afflixisse.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="13" xml:lang="la">Quodsi verum esset, fama <lb xml:id="p1z32"/>haec confirmarentur; quae tamen non confirmantur, ut pla<lb xml:id="p1z33"/>ne dubitem de narratione illa etc.</s>
					<s n="14" xml:lang="la">Illud tamen iterum <lb xml:id="p1z34"/>pro certo habetote 15 currus oneratos pulvere bomba<lb xml:id="p1z35"/>rdico festinasse ad <placeName ref="l2459">Rhenum</placeName>, ut illa vis pulveris <lb xml:id="p1z36"/>bombardici imposita navibus veheretur ad <persName>Albanum</persName> <lb xml:id="p1z38"/>in <placeName ref="l808">Belgium</placeName>, ubi laborant prorsus inopia pulveris illius.</s>
					<s n="15" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z39"/>Verum non procul a <placeName ref="l2459">Rheno</placeName> interceperunt aliquot <lb xml:id="p1z40"/>equites nigri illos currus et pulverem incensum <lb xml:id="p1z41"/>in aerem disploserunt etc.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="16" xml:lang="la" ana="salute">Saluta utrumque consulem, <persName ref="p6130">Pontisellam</persName> utrumque, <lb xml:id="p1z42"/><persName ref="p1770">Carolum</persName>, <persName ref="p8057">Campellum</persName>, <persName>Victorem</persName>, <persName ref="p8186">Bonetum</persName>, <persName ref="p8433">Ioannem illum meum <lb xml:id="p1z43"/>a Salicibus</persName>, commissarium, et alios fratres et amicos.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="17" xml:lang="la"><placeName ref="l587">Tiguri</placeName> 6. novembris <lb xml:id="p1z44"/>1573.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="18" xml:lang="de">Wie ists mitt miner herren brieff üwer eerenliebe <lb xml:id="p1z45"/>hußfrowen beträffend ergangen?</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="19" xml:lang="la">Optime ei puto consultum; salva sit.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="20" xml:lang="la"><persName ref="p495">Bullinger<lb xml:id="p1z46"/>us</persName> tuus.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="21" xml:lang="de"><pb/><lb xml:id="p2z1"/>Dem wolgelerten, frommen <lb xml:id="p2z2"/>und getruwen herren <lb xml:id="p2z3"/><persName ref="p8016">Thobia Egli</persName>, pfarreren <lb xml:id="p2z4"/>zuͦ S. Martin zuͦ <placeName ref="l98">Chur</placeName>, <lb xml:id="p2z5"/>minem günstigen herren <lb xml:id="p2z6"/>und bruͦ<lb xml:id="p2z7"/>der.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="22" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p2z8"/><placeName ref="l98">Chur</placeName>.</s>
				</p>
